      "text": "A small cover thumbnail in Figure 2 showing the WHO Regional Office for South-East Asia report \"Decade for health workforce strengthening in the South-East Asia Region 2015–2024: Second review of progress, 2018\": a white upper half with a circular emblem and title above a solid blue lower half with the WHO logo.",
